  "id": "fruit-and-pecan-layer-cake",
  "name": "Fruit and Pecan Layer Cake",
  "subtitle": "A light layer cake finished with fruit, pecans, and frosting",
  "description": "A tender vanilla cake is baked in layers, cooled, combined with a raisin-cherry-pecan frosting mixture, and finished with the remaining frosting.",
